    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6aed8442",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: obama_skidmark_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a close-up image of former U.S. President Barack Obama, juxtaposed with the text 'notice how the kenyan skidmark has been silent about the mueller report?'. This combines a racially charged stereotype (referencing Obama's Kenyan heritage with the derogatory term 'skidmark') with a politically charged accusation about his silence on the Mueller Report. The intent is to demean Obama by invoking racist tropes and to question his integrity or loyalty, thereby attacking him based on his race and political stance. This constitutes a hateful meme as it directly targets an individual based on his race and political affiliation, using offensive language and false equivalence to undermine his credibility.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_15ab15ce"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
