      "instance_name": "Barack_Obama",
      "label": "Former U.S. President",
      "description": "A close-up portrait of Barack Obama, former President of the United States, showing his face and upper torso. He is wearing a dark suit, light blue shirt, and a patterned tie. His expression is serious and somber, with his gaze directed slightly off-camera. The background is blurred, suggesting an official or formal setting. This image is widely recognized and is being used in the meme context to reference his political persona and racial identity.",
