      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "kenyan_skidmark_stereotype",
      "label": "Kenyan Skidmark Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory racial stereotype that falsely associates Barack Obama's Kenyan heritage with a crude, degrading physical description ('skidmark'), implying he is somehow 'dirty' or 'low-class' due to his race. This is a racist trope used to demean him based on his ethnicity, not his character or accomplishments.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
